BEGIN
  /*
   {"diagramJson":"{\"title\":\"02_target_the_marketing_campaign\",\"description\":\"Builds a PlacePulse profile for each Erewhon store and scores each H3 cell in Los Angeles by its similarity to the stores and its current visits.\",\"nodes\":[{\"id\":\"2e06cc53-2de4-41bf-bd69-21c2f6881451\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"Note\",\"color\":\"#E5E5E5\",\"genAi\":false,\"label\":\"\",\"width\":448,\"height\":447.998,\"inputs\":[],\"markdown\":\"---\\nlabel: Overview\\n---\\n## Target the marketing campaign\\nErewhon is an upscale, organic grocery store chain and pop-culture lifestyle brand based in the Greater Los Angeles area. This workflow uses the visitors of its 13 stores to find the areas of LA where a marketing campaign has the most potential.\\n\\nEach store gets a profile, which is the visit-weighted mean of the PlacePulse embeddings of the cells that its visitors come from. An embedding is a numeric vector that describes the urban character of one H3 cell.\\n\\n- **Store profiles:** one unit-length profile vector for each store.\\n- **Store similarity:** compares the 13 profiles with each other.\\n- **Targeting score:** ranks each LA cell by its similarity to the profiles and by its current visits.\",\"position\":{\"x\":-48,\"y\":-432}},\"type\":\"note\",\"width\":640,\"height\":496,\"zIndex\":-1,\"dragging\":false,\"position\":{\"x\":-48,\"y\":-432},\"selected\":false,\"positionAbsolute\":{\"x\":192,\"y\":-784}},{\"id\":\"40bfc019-467f-4281-9a96-f759b348ee8d\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"Note\",\"color\":\"#F6CF71\",\"genAi\":false,\"label\":\"\",\"width\":399.995,\"height\":448,\"inputs\":[],\"markdown\":\"---\\nlabel: Data\\n---\\n## Inputs\\n- **PlacePulse embeddings**: One row per H3 cell in Los Angeles. `GEOID` is the H3 index. The `emb_*` columns are the embedding dimensions.\\n- **Erewhon visits**: Visits from each H3 cell (`h7`) to each of the 13 Erewhon stores (`store_name`, `visits`).\",\"position\":{\"x\":416,\"y\":-432}},\"type\":\"note\",\"width\":320,\"height\":240,\"zIndex\":-1,\"dragging\":false,\"position\":{\"x\":416,\"y\":-432},\"selected\":false,\"positionAbsolute\":{\"x\":192,\"y\":-256}},{\"id\":\"5ff80cce-1218-42f4-8b0f-07bf06b62bab\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"Note\",\"color\":\"#9EB9F3\",\"genAi\":false,\"label\":\"\",\"width\":576,\"height\":447.997,\"inputs\":[],\"markdown\":\"---\\nlabel: Store profiles\\n---\\n## Build one profile for each store\\n1. **Join** attaches the embedding of each origin cell to its visits.\\n2. **Embedding Profile** calculates the visit-weighted mean embedding for each store. A cell with many visits pulls the profile more than a cell with few visits.\\n3. **Vector Normalisation** rescales each profile to length 1. With unit-length vectors, the Dot product metric returns the same values as Cosine.\",\"position\":{\"x\":831.997,\"y\":-432}},\"type\":\"note\",\"width\":512,\"height\":272,\"zIndex\":-1,\"dragging\":false,\"position\":{\"x\":832,\"y\":-432},\"selected\":false,\"positionAbsolute\":{\"x\":832,\"y\":112}},{\"id\":\"fd89b825-76d0-417f-9a93-b3bd5fa6d7d4\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"Note\",\"color\":\"#DCB0F2\",\"genAi\":false,\"label\":\"\",\"width\":479.99899999999997,\"height\":287.993,\"inputs\":[],\"markdown\":\"---\\nlabel: Store similarity\\n---\\n## How alike are the store profiles?\\n**Similarity Search** compares each store profile with every other store profile.\",\"position\":{\"x\":1424,\"y\":-160}},\"type\":\"note\",\"width\":416,\"height\":224,\"zIndex\":-1,\"dragging\":false,\"position\":{\"x\":1424,\"y\":-160},\"selected\":false,\"positionAbsolute\":{\"x\":1488,\"y\":288}},{\"id\":\"78f4faac-b438-41ea-9777-7f6a2e15ca67\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"Note\",\"color\":\"#8BE0A4\",\"genAi\":false,\"label\":\"\",\"width\":799.992,\"height\":495.993,\"inputs\":[],\"markdown\":\"---\\nlabel: Targeting score\\n---\\n## Find similar cells with few visits\\n1. **Similarity Search** compares each LA cell with the 13 store profiles and takes the average similarity.\\n2. **Group by** sums the current visits of each cell across all stores.\\n3. **Join**, **Create Column** and **Drop Columns** attach the visits to every cell. A cell with no visits gets 0.\\n4. **Composite Score Unsupervised** combines the two variables with equal weights. The visits variable is reversed, so a cell with high similarity and few visits gets the highest score.\\n\",\"position\":{\"x\":1424,\"y\":-672}},\"type\":\"note\",\"width\":816,\"height\":352,\"zIndex\":-1,\"dragging\":false,\"position\":{\"x\":1424,\"y\":-672},\"selected\":false,\"positionAbsolute\":{\"x\":1488,\"y\":-592}},{\"id\":\"98dcc9dd-1f85-4eed-b00f-ef84dcdca3f5\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"native.joinv2\",\"type\":\"generic\",\"label\":\"Join\",\"inputs\":[{\"name\":\"lefttable\",\"type\":\"Table\",\"title\":\"Left table\",\"description\":\"Left table\"},{\"name\":\"righttable\",\"type\":\"Table\",\"title\":\"Right table\",\"description\":\"Right table\"},{\"name\":\"lefttablekeycolumn\",\"type\":\"Column\",\"title\":\"Key column in left table\",\"parent\":\"lefttable\",\"dataType\":[\"boolean\",\"date\",\"datetime\",\"time\",\"timestamp\",\"number\",\"string\"],\"description\":\"Key column in left table\",\"value\":\"h7\"},{\"name\":\"lefttablecolumns\",\"type\":\"ColumnsForJoin\",\"title\":\"Left table columns\",\"parent\":\"lefttable\",\"optional\":true,\"description\":\"Left table columns\",\"value\":\"[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"store_name\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"store_name\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"visits\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"visits\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"h7\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"h7\\\"}]\"},{\"name\":\"righttablekeycolumn\",\"type\":\"Column\",\"title\":\"Key column in right table\",\"parent\":\"righttable\",\"dataType\":[\"boolean\",\"date\",\"datetime\",\"time\",\"timestamp\",\"number\",\"string\"],\"description\":\"Key column in right table\",\"value\":\"GEOID\"},{\"name\":\"righttablecolumns\",\"type\":\"ColumnsForJoin\",\"title\":\"Right table columns\",\"parent\":\"righttable\",\"optional\":true,\"description\":\"Right table columns\",\"value\":\"[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_0\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_0\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_1\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_1\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_2\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_2\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_3\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_3\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_4\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_4\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_5\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_5\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_6\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_6\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_7\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_7\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_8\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_8\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_9\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_9\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_10\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_10\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_11\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_11\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_12\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_12\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_13\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_13\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_14\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_14\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_15\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_15\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_16\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_16\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_17\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_17\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_18\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_18\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_19\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_19\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_20\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_20\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_21\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_21\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_22\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_22\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_23\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_23\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_24\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_24\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_25\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_25\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_26\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_26\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_27\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_27\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_28\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_28\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_29\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_29\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_30\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_30\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_31\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_